            </paragraph>
            <paragraph>The new designs use design tokens: named values for colors, spacing, radii and type. Change a handful of tokens and the whole site follows, in light mode and in dark mode.</paragraph>
            <section>
              <section>
                <header>Respecting the reader</header>
                <paragraph>The designs follow the reader's system settings for dark mode and reduced motion, keep text contrast above 4.5:1 and work from a 320 pixel phone to a wide desktop.</paragraph>
              </section>
            </section>
          </section>
